  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When player enters in VRC_Station or leaves out, it is not always synced between all players. So player can sit on the chair but for someones it will be appears like person is still standing. Or person can stand from chair but for some other players it will be appears like person still sitting. In both cases affected person's body it's start flickering between two states.\n\nBy me this was first noticed in September, but wasn't too frequent. Now I meet this almost every day on various maps with chairs on pickups. This bug seems to be not stable because every time I met it, ask ppl about that, and some ppl says \"everything is fine\" and some says \"yea, it's flickering\".\n\nHere is video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M8ILg_s-L7I (sorry for low fps - in my OBS hw encoder is broken, so I use laggy software encoder)\nIn exactly this video it's stools from https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_a5aa8c95-1903-4ce1-a2df-0027964e4b3e This is my world, I made that stools in spring (probably in late April .. early May) and I didn't changed prefabs from that moment. It was working perfect until late Aug .. early Sep, when that bug starts appear.\n\nI also suspect that it can be related to master change, becuase this often happens in public worlds with huge players rotation, and not that frequent in private instances.",
